AB 及 PyTorch/TensorFlow 开展算法建模、训练与多工况评估。以第一作者或通讯作者发表论文 11 篇，其中 SCI 期刊 6 篇，并承担多项科研与工程课题，具备独立推进复杂技术问题、形成技术文档与阶段性成果， 以及跨团队协同完成工程闭环的能力。"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section shell","id":"capabilities","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-label","children":"CORE CAPABILITIES"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"科研与工程能力"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"能够把动力学机理、数值仿真、智能算法与工程验证串联起来，并形成可复核的技术结果。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"research-grid","children":[["$","article","01",{"className":"research-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"card-topline","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Multiphysics coupled simulation"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"多物理场耦合仿真"}],"$Lb","$Lc"]}],"$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}]]}],"$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]
